695a0fd70580ce0ca70eacb3e2da4c57a0015cdfe12e508f9d7a53382a8c38f52530530ac16eab6e34ad5a9d8f6ac70a725cb380d6061b4515c5c2da0de360ae  0001-cad-pulse-don-t-crash-when-no-suitable-card-is-found.patch
"
